ntuplink-mech-teleporter-medium-name = Assault Mech Teleporter
ntuplink-mech-teleporter-medium-desc = Contains a crate holding a fast Foundation mech. A fast, medium-armored mech in the Foundation's service. You'll be the first to die — but what a way to go!
ntuplink-mech-teleporter-heavy-name = Heavy Mech Teleporter
ntuplink-mech-teleporter-heavy-desc = Contains a crate holding a heavy Foundation mech. As slow as it is well-protected. You'll be the last to die.
ntuplink-mech-teleporter-eliteheavy-name = Elite Heavy Mech Teleporter
ntuplink-mech-teleporter-eliteheavy-desc = Contains a crate holding the Foundation's finest mech. Available only for the most dangerous missions. For Senior Officers only!
ntuplink-mech-powercage-nanotrasen-name = Foundation Power Cell
ntuplink-mech-powercage-nanotrasen-desc = A rechargeable power cell for large-scale devices. Features increased capacity for enhanced power output. EMP-shielded.
ntuplink-deathrattle-implant-desc = A box containing 6 "Death Rattle" implants. When you enter a critical state, it transmits a message containing your coordinates to your superiors via radio channel.
